When we declare the internal table the syntax is data : t_internaltablename type table of ty_tablename 
in above note we have used the 'type table of'  if we will remove this then it will turn in to work area & we know work area is only compatible to hold the 1 field While the internal table can hold the multiple field
"the internal table can be created with header or without header 
recommend to create without header
To declare that the table is standard there is two syntax
1. data  t_internaltablename type table of ty_tablename with header line.
2. data t_emp1 type standard table of ty_emp with header line.

header line --- is same as the work are that can store the single record one by one its present at the top of the internal table 
and the internal table is located in the below part of the header table 
& it have the rows & colums to store multiple data 

we understand in simple terms that the header is present on the top of body & the below is callled body that we can also call the internal tabl;e 

now if we are trying to fetche the database directly from the db it will present directly in internal table body 
but if we manually inserting the data then  we will firt put the data in header then in the internal table








